# AGENTS.md

## Project Overview

This repository is a small Python data-processing/reporting workspace centered on Qdrant collections:

- `misfit_crew.py`: end-to-end mining pipeline from `meta_reflections` into `misfit_reports`
- `misfit_report_pull.py`: exports `misfit_reports` entries into Markdown review files
- `canon_alignment_report.py`: corpus-level clustering/frequency analysis over `meta_reflections`
- `reviews/`: generated Markdown outputs
- `misfit_ledger.json` / `misfit_failures.json`: runtime state/audit artifacts for `misfit_crew.py`

A local `venv/` directory exists in-repo; avoid treating it as project source.

## Repository Structure

- Root scripts (entrypoints):
  - `misfit_crew.py`
  - `misfit_report_pull.py`
  - `canon_alignment_report.py`
- Data/state files:
  - `misfit_ledger.json` (append-only audit log)
  - `misfit_failures.json` (retry/dead-well tracking)
- Output directory:
  - `reviews/` (report markdown, including backups)

No package layout (`src/`, modules, setup/pyproject) was found; this is script-driven.

